title: '2026-11-14: a replaced root now draws every folder from the new root, and ''view'' of a root a perspective put in place lands in that view. Committed as b29c20f6.'
pid: 8c23feb4-255e-4546-8899-32eb39dfb38f
body: |2-
  Answering your mission "Draw every folder of a replaced root from the
  new root". Tests pass ('bash/all-tests.sh', and skg-for-ai's own), each
  new test failing without its change; a fresh reviewer read the change
  against your words twice; what the first pass found is mended, and
  the second pass's one real finding is written down, not mended (the
  last child here). My choices are children of "Decided by Jeff: a
  replaced root shows its own folders" in [[id:bf4c2010-1253-46c0-b65d-35d484eef955][the perspective switch as built]].
contains:
- 8db2ffb3-bf9b-44c5-9a9e-5abdcc3e24d2
